// RegExp.last 静态属性 + 匹配位置码点语义 / last：test/exec 更新（失败也更新），match/replace 不更新
Scripts.execStorage("../../assert.tjs");

var r1 = /(\d+)/;
r1.test("a123b");
var l1 = RegExp.last.lastMatch;
/zzz/.test("aaa");
var l2 = RegExp.last.lastMatch;
var r3 = /b/;
r3.match("abc");
var l3 = RegExp.last.lastMatch;
"xxx".replace(/x/, "y");
var l4 = RegExp.last.lastMatch;
var r5 = /(\d+)-(\d+)/;
r5.exec("77-42");
var l5 = RegExp.last.lastParen;
var r6 = /zzz/;
r6.exec("aaa");
var l6 = RegExp.last.lastMatch;
assertTrue(((l1)) == "123");
assertTrue(((l2)) == "");
assertTrue(((l3)) == "");
assertTrue(((l4)) == "");
assertTrue(((l5)) == "42");
assertTrue(((l6)) == "");

finishTests();
